      "normative_level": "SHOULD",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "client",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "When the timer fires, the UAC SHOULD attempt the re-INVITE once more, if it still desires for that session modification to take place.",
